arsenal.ui.guide_1=§l§6Firing
arsenal.ui.guide_10=§fC4: throw it, then use the Detonator. Landmine: use on the top of a block.
arsenal.ui.guide_11=§l§6Crafting
arsenal.ui.guide_12=§fSteel = iron + 2 coal. Weapon Bench, Ammo Press and Ammo Crate are crafted at a crafting table.
arsenal.ui.guide_13=§fLegendary weapons: ancient cities, bastions and Raider Captains.
arsenal.ui.guide_14=§fTraining Target: shows damage, hit zone and DPS. Sneak-hit it to pick it up.
arsenal.ui.guide_2=§fUse (right-click / tap & hold / LT) to fire. Automatic weapons fire while held. On mobile you can switch full-auto to tap-to-start / tap-to-stop in Personal Settings.
arsenal.ui.guide_3=§fSneak to aim down sights (ADS): tighter spread, zoom, less recoil.
arsenal.ui.guide_4=§fDouble-tap sneak to reload or clear a jam.
arsenal.ui.guide_5=§fPress sneak while jumping to switch fire mode.
arsenal.ui.guide_6=§fLook straight up and use: weapon menu (attachments, ammo type, mode, stats).
arsenal.ui.guide_7=§fWith a scope, press jump while aiming to hold your breath (steadier aim). Guns without a scope aim down their iron sights.
arsenal.ui.guide_8=§l§6Grenades
arsenal.ui.guide_9=§fHold use to pull the pin, release to throw. Frags cook while held. Sneak to see the arc.
